### clyDrive — Files & Folders
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Upload a file
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/files/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----clydrive

------clydrive
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="notes.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

hello clydrive
------clydrive--

### List files (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/files?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### File metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/files/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Download file
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/files/1/download
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Move file into a folder
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/files/1/move
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "folderId": 1
}

### Delete file
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/files/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create folder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/folders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Documents"
}

### Create nested folder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/folders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invoices",
  "parentId": 1
}

### List root folders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/folders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Folder contents + breadcrumbs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/folders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Rename folder
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/folders/1/rename
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Archive"
}

### Delete folder (must be empty)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/folders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
